## Cache {#cache}

:::requirement{#R1 status=accepted} The cache keeps results for 10 minutes
Pricing pages use the same cache.
:::

:::comment{for=R1 author=@maya date=2026-11-06 rev=000000000000} Too long?
Pricing changes hourly, so 10 minutes may show stale prices.
:::

:::suggestion{for=R1 author=@agent date=2026-11-06} Shorter cache
The cache keeps results for 5 minutes, and pricing pages bypass it.
:::

:::suggestion{for=R1 author=@agent date=2026-11-05 status=rejected by=@maya on=2026-11-06 reason="Too aggressive"} No cache
Remove the cache.
:::

:::comment{for=cache author=@sam date=2026-11-04 status=resolved by=@sam on=2026-11-05} Typo in the heading
:::

